various product packaging and play a substantial role in environmental degradation. Accumulation of polyethylene remains in the environment can lead to the blockage of waterways, resulting in distressed water supplies, and can cause the death of several living organisms due to their consumption. It clogs drainage systems and rivers and is a leading cause of animal deaths consumed by animals looking
